            "reviewBody": "first time, too sweet and blah tasting.\n Second time I made some changes.. Citrus Vodka, ....switched the amounts of grapefruit and cranberry around, and a squirt of lime juice. Took a taste and added another 1/2 ounce of the vodka. It was decent after that. Its just too sweet in the original recipe",
