            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "kikikim"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The hot August sun made me desiring a refreshing no nonsense alcoholic beverage.The Sea Breeze cocktail has achieved a place in my heart as far as thirst quinching summer cocktails go.Tart from the lime,but oh so refreshing and pleasant! I love that this drink doesn't break my wallet with all the expensive liquior one is required to buy when making a really good cocktail! Like another reviewer, I squeezed all the lime slice into my glass and let the it drop on the bottom of my ice filled glass. I had to substitute Diet cranberry pineapple juice instead of cranberry and grapefruit juice because that is what I had in the fridge. I am looking forward to another soon! ;]",
            "datePublished": "2019-08-18T21:17:22.637Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tony"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Interesting! We used to make these by the pitcher every summer but ours were more of a greyhound cocktail with some cranberry thrown in - - we used about four parts grapefruit juice to one part cranberry juice and always a few lime wedges squeezed and tossed into the pitcher. But this is great too, just different.",
            "datePublished": "2019-07-01T17:57:43.187Z"
          },
